        <h1 class="profile-detail-name">Mogao Caves</h1>
        <div class="info-stats" style="margin-top:10px;">
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Period</span><span class="info-stat-val">c. 366 CE – present</span></div>
          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Made by</span><span class="info-stat-val">Dug and decorated by Buddhist monks over about a thousand years, from the 4th to the 14th century, with funds from donors: clergy, local rulers, foreign dignitaries, Chinese emperors, merchants, officers and local families</span></div>
